    "wooden": {
      "sourceUrl": "https://cwars.miraheze.org/wiki/Wooden_Chest",
      "texts": [
        "Wooden Chest",
        "Wooden Chest",
        "Wooden chests take 3 minutes to unlock. The number of cards and gold inside depend on the league you were at when you got the chest. There is a 0.25% chance to get an epic and a 4.75% chance to get a rare in a wooden chest. Unlike any other variety of chest, Wooden Chests only drop for players in leagues 30-26, effectively being replaced by Common Chests afterwards.",
        "Contents",
        " [ hide ]",
        "Speeding up chests",
        "Wooden Chests can be opened immediately by paying gems - though, given the low waiting time and the low league the player is in, it's highly not suggested to do so. As of August 2019, progression is linear and ratio is not affected by \"Time Loop\" Guild Bonus.",
        "Wooden Chest Rewards",
        "PC-browser",
        "Mobile",
        ": ",
        "Cookies help us deliver our services. By using our services, you agree to our use of cookies.",
