    "common": {
      "sourceUrl": "https://cwars.miraheze.org/wiki/Common_Chest",
      "texts": [
        "Common Chest",
        "Common Chest",
        "Starting from ",
        " 25 you can get Common Chests. It takes 1h ",
        " to unlock a Common Chest without using the \"Time Loop\" ",
        ". The number of cards and the amount of gold inside a Common Chest depends on the current league at which you got it.",
        "During ",
        " all Common Chests will give Event ",
        " instead of Soul Dust with the PC-browser version giving 20 Event Sparks and the Mobile version giving 30 Event Sparks.",
        "There is a 0.25% chance to get an epic and a 4.75% chance to get a rare in a Common Chest. Common chests have a 75% drop chance for leagues 25-11 and a 75.2% drop chance for leagues 10-GM. (Update, 15 Apr 2021: in a data set of over 1000 PvP drops in L2 & L1, the value is close to 64%.)",
        "Contents",
        " [ hide ]",
        "Speeding up chests",
        "Common Chests can be opened immediately by paying gems. Progression is linear and ratio is not affected by \"Time Loop\" Guild Bonus. There are differences between PC and mobile clients:",
        "Common Chest Rewards",
