    "rare": {
      "sourceUrl": "https://cwars.miraheze.org/wiki/Rare_Chest",
      "texts": [
        "Rare Chest",
        "Rare Chest",
        "Starting from ",
        " 25 you can get Rare Chests. It takes 3:00 hours ",
        " to unlock a Rare Chest without using the \"Time Loop\" ",
        ". The number of cards and amount of gold inside a Rare Chest depends on the current league at which you got it. Some quests in ",
        " require you to open Rare Chests. For this purpose, ",
        " in Summon are considered to be a rare chest for each stack of rare cards you get.",
        "During ",
        " all Rare Chests will give Event ",
        " instead of Soul Dust with the PC-browser version giving 40 Event Sparks and the Mobile version giving 60 Event Sparks.",
        "There is a 0.5% chance to get an epic in a Rare Chest until league 20 in which it becomes a 5% chance. Rare chests have a 19.5% drop chance for leagues 25-21, a 21.2% drop chance for leagues 20-11, and a 20% drop chance for leagues 10-GM. (Update, 15 Apr 2021, in a dataset of over 1000 PvP drops, taken from L2 & L1, the drop rate was close to 25%).",
        "Contents",
        " [ hide ]",
        "Speeding up chests",
        "Rare Chests can be opened immediately by paying gems. Progression is linear and ratio is not affected by \"Time Loop\" Guild Bonus. There are differences between PC and mobile clients:",
