      "texts": [
        "Big Rare Chest",
        "Big Rare Chest",
        "Starting from ",
        " 26 you can get Big Rare Chests. It takes 6:00 hours ",
        " to unlock a Big Rare Chest without using the \"Time Loop\" ",
        ". The number of cards and amount of gold inside a Big Rare Chest depends on the current league at which you got it.",
        "During ",
        " all Big Rare Chests will give 60 Event ",
        " instead of Soul Dust. The amount of Event Sparks is the same on both the PC-browser and the Mobile version.",
        "There is a 1% chance to get an epic in a Rare Chest until league 20 in which it becomes a 5% chance. Big Rare Chests are a 3.8% drop chance for leagues 26-GM. (Update, 15 Apr 2021: in a data set of over 1000 PvP chests from L2 & L1, the drop value was around 9%)",
        "Contents",
