    "epic": {
      "sourceUrl": "https://cwars.miraheze.org/wiki/Epic_Chest",
      "texts": [
        "Epic Chest",
        "Due to recent additions and rebalances as of April 2020, the information in ",
        "can be inaccurate in parts or as a whole.",
        "This template will be removed once the page is fully updated.",
        "Epic Chest",
        "Starting from ",
        " 20 you can get Epic Chests. It takes 24:00 hours ",
        " to unlock an Epic Chest without using the \"Time Loop\" ",
        ". The number of cards and amount of gold inside an Epic Chest depends on the league level at which you got it. Some quests in Events require you to open Epic Chests in Event shop.",
        "During ",
        " all Epic Chests will give Event ",
        " instead of Soul Dust with the PC-browser version giving 60 Event Sparks and the Mobile version giving 70 Event Sparks.",
        "Getting legendary cards in a Epic Chests is a 0.25% chance. Epic chests are a 1.2% drop chance for leagues 20-GM.",
        "Contents",
        " [ ]",
        "Speeding up chests",
        "Epic Chests can be opened immediately by paying gems. As of August 2019, progression is linear and ratio is not affected by \"Time Loop\" Guild Bonus. There are differences between PC and mobile clients:",
        "Epic Chest Rewards",
        "[Collapse]",
        "PC-browser",
        "[Collapse]",
        "Mobile",
