      "sourceUrl": "https://cwars.miraheze.org/wiki/Legendary_Chest",
      "texts": [
        "Legendary Chest",
        "Due to recent additions and rebalances as of April 2020, the information in ",
        "can be inaccurate in parts or as a whole.",
        "This template will be removed once the page is fully updated.",
        "Legendary Chest",
        "Starting from ",
        " 10 you can get Legendary Chests. It takes 36h ",
        " to unlock a Legendary Chest without using the \"Time Loop\" ",
        ". The quantity of the rewards in the Legendary Chest depend on the league that the chest was obtained in. Some quests in Events require you to open Epic Chests in Event shop.",
        "During ",
        " all Legendary Chests will give 100 Event ",
        " instead of Soul Dust.",
        "Legendary chests have a 0.3% drop chance for leagues 10-GM.",
        "Contents",
        " [ ]",
        "Speeding up chests",
        "Legendary Chests can be opened immediately by paying gems. As of August 2019, progression is linear and ratio is not affected by \"Time Loop\" Guild Bonus. There are differences between PC and mobile clients:",
        "Legendary Chest Rewards",
        "PC-browser",
        "Mobile",
        "Other legendary chests",
        "Other Legendary Chests can be obtained from ",
        " or ",
        " with different amounts of souls, soul dust, friend coins, event sparks, and gold. They are not locked before league 10.",
        ": ",
