    "wins": {
      "sourceUrl": "https://cwars.miraheze.org/wiki/Wins_Chest",
      "texts": [
        "Wins Chest",
        "Wins Chest",
        "Wins Chests are earned for every three wins in ",
        ": each win adds a star above the chest, which can be opened once three stars have been collected. No further stars can be collected until the Wins Chest is opened.",
        "An 8h ",
        " starts after  every third  the first opened Win Chest, During the cooldown period, two more Win chests can be gained after which stars for the next Wins Chest cannot be collected until the cool down period is over.",
        "The amount of gold and cards inside the Wins Chest depends on your league level when you open the chest. Wins Chests won't give any Event ",
        " during ",
        ".",
